nd C545 HEPA Filter S, with the latter associated with part number 1712-0096-00.", "The C545 replacement filter is explicitly described as a True HEPA filter, while the C610 Filter Z is listed as a 4-stage replacement.", "Third-party replacements are available in multi-packs, specifically 2-packs for the C610 and 4-packs for the C545, offering value alternatives to single-unit purchases."]', 'enriched') ON CONFLICT(slug) DO UPDATE SET official_filter_code=excluded.official_filter_code, hepa_grade=excluded.hepa_grade, filter_shape=excluded.filter_shape, dimensions_json=excluded.dimensions_json, compatibility_warning=excluded.compatibility_warning, faqs_json=excluded.faqs_json, direct_answer_capsule=excluded.direct_answer_capsule, key_takeaways_json=excluded.key_takeaways_json, status=excluded.status, updated_at=CURRENT_TIMESTAMP;
