he replacement for the Type R filter in the HPA 100/200/300 series.", "Listings confirm the use of HEPA filtration, with some third-party options including additional activated carbon pre-filters for enhanced air quality.", "Buyers can choose between the official Honeywell 3-pack or third-party alternatives that often bundle extra pre-filters, such as the 3 R filters plus 4 carbon pre-filters."]', 'enriched') ON CONFLICT(slug) DO UPDATE SET official_filter_code=excluded.official_filter_code, hepa_grade=excluded.hepa_grade, filter_shape=excluded.filter_shape, dimensions_json=excluded.dimensions_json, compatibility_warning=excluded.compatibility_warning, faqs_json=excluded.faqs_json, direct_answer_capsule=excluded.direct_answer_capsule, key_takeaways_json=excluded.key_takeaways_json, status=excluded.status, updated_at=CURRENT_TIMESTAMP;
