C4900 variants.", "The filter assembly consists of H13 True HEPA filters paired with carbon pre-filters, as explicitly stated in the product titles.", "Available options include single filter replacements and multi-packs containing 4 H13 HEPA filters and 8 carbon pre-filters, all from third-party sources."]', 'enriched') ON CONFLICT(slug) DO UPDATE SET official_filter_code=excluded.official_filter_code, hepa_grade=excluded.hepa_grade, filter_shape=excluded.filter_shape, dimensions_json=excluded.dimensions_json, compatibility_warning=excluded.compatibility_warning, faqs_json=excluded.faqs_json, direct_answer_capsule=excluded.direct_answer_capsule, key_takeaways_json=excluded.key_takeaways_json, status=excluded.status, updated_at=CURRENT_TIMESTAMP;
